<title>SPAIN: Spain Petronor refinery plans strike from Friday.</title>
<headline>Spain Petronor refinery plans strike from Friday.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Repsol unit Petronor is planning a strike from 1600 GMT on Friday March 21, a spokeswoman for the unit said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a strike from (1600 GMT) tomorrow at the Bilbao refinery,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>She said no further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
